(7684469, 1257849, 135744, '<td valign="top">haha brilliant! That looks like an interesting set up. I picked up an Oculus Quest 2 for xmas and I am hooking that up to a cheap exercise bike with VZFit (https://www.virzoom.com/) and really enjoying cycling anywhere in the world. The app uses Google Maps data so it is not perfect but I am absolutely loving being able to choose where I cycle each morning. I get to cycle in Ireland :)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'haha brilliant! That looks like an interesting set up. I picked up an Oculus Quest 2 for xmas and I am hooking that up to a cheap exercise bike with VZFit (https://www.virzoom.com/) and really enjoying cycling anywhere in the world. The app uses Google Maps data so it is not perfect but I am absolutely loving being able to choose where I cycle each morning. I get to cycle in Ireland :) Congrats on the HM!', '2021-01-15 02:38:15.000000', NULL, 0),
