(7684548, 1257750, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwinick:</b></div><hr/><i> great idea eat them before the flesh turns yellow, I dont know but I was told that in still life the subjects should be an Odd number.why? I dont know others might know </i></td></tr></table>thank you.  I think the even number works because of the odd one...Just my opinion.  It was not as dramatic with 3 apples.</td>', 'Originally posted by kiwinick: great idea eat them before the flesh turns yellow, I dont know but I was told that in still life the subjects should be an Odd number.why? I dont know others might know thank you.  I think the even number works because of the odd one...Just my opinion.  It was not as dramatic with 3 apples.', '2021-01-15 15:33:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684549, 1257750, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> This is my favorite of the challenge!<br/> <br/>I like the fake leaves... but I think apples would only have one.<br/> <br/>I''m sure it will do well for you.  Congratulations! </i></td></tr></table> Thanks Lydia...hard to find apples in Florida with leaves on them. Need to be in an apple orchard!</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: This is my favorite of the challenge! I like the fake leaves... but I think apples would only have one. I''m sure it will do well for you.  Congratulations!  Thanks Lydia...hard to find apples in Florida with leaves on them. Need to be in an apple orchard!', '2021-01-15 15:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
