(7684558, 1257917, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, Barry! ...Incidentally, I''m about to pull the trigger on Mavic Air 2. Seems like it can be a ribbon-getter )) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The <strike>FCC</strike> FAA states that there is a limit of 5 owners per any internet photo contest site.  I think Paul snuck in before the final rule was written.  Sorry Lev, but you''re going to have to find something else to spend your money on.  :-D   I wonder if Robert is thinking the same.  LOL<br/> <br/>Edit to correct - Dangit.  I was thinking FAA, not sure why I typed FCC?  Gah.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-01-16 12:24:06.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Congrats, Barry! ...Incidentally, I''m about to pull the trigger on Mavic Air 2. Seems like it can be a ribbon-getter ))   The FCC FAA states that there is a limit of 5 owners per any internet photo contest site.  I think Paul snuck in before the final rule was written.  Sorry Lev, but you''re going to have to find something else to spend your money on.  :-D   I wonder if Robert is thinking the same.  LOL Edit to correct - Dangit.  I was thinking FAA, not sure why I typed FCC?  Gah.', '2021-01-15 17:21:25.000000', '2021-01-16 12:24:06.000000', 0),
