(7684635, 1257917, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, Barry! ...Incidentally, I''m about to pull the trigger on Mavic Air 2. Seems like it can be a ribbon-getter )) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The FCC states that there is a limit of 5 owners per any internet photo contest site.  I think Paul snuck in before the final rule was written.  Sorry Lev, but you''re going to have to find something else to spend your money on.  :-D   I wonder if Robert is thinking the same.  LOL </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Absolutely. The skies are getting too crowded in DPCland. Here''s an idea for you: get one of those SUBMERSIBLE drones and show us deepscapes :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Originally posted by LevT: Congrats, Barry! ...Incidentally, I''m about to pull the trigger on Mavic Air 2. Seems like it can be a ribbon-getter ))  The FCC states that there is a limit of 5 owners per any internet photo contest site.  I think Paul snuck in before the final rule was written.  Sorry Lev, but you''re going to have to find something else to spend your money on.  :-D   I wonder if Robert is thinking the same.  LOL  Absolutely. The skies are getting too crowded in DPCland. Here''s an idea for you: get one of those SUBMERSIBLE drones and show us deepscapes :-)', '2021-01-16 10:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
